    "one_liner": "为 Jupyter 提供 IPython 计算引擎的 Python 库，基于 ZeroMQ 与前端通信",
    "ecosystem": "python",
    "bindings": []
  },
  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "ipykernel 是 Jupyter 生态的 IPython 内核实现。它作为一个长期运行的 Python 进程，通过 ZeroMQ 套接字接收前端（Notebook、JupyterLab、qtconsole 等）发来的 Jupyter 协议消息，执行 Python 代码并把结果/输出回传。除了核心执行引擎，它还提供 IOPub 输出转发、调试器（debugpy）集成、Comm 双向通信、子 shell、GUI 事件循环集成（Qt/GTK/wx/Tk/Cocoa）以及内核安装规格生成等能力。目标用户是 Jupyter 前端开发者与需要在自己的工具中嵌入交互式 Python 内核的开发者。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "Jupyter 协议内核",
        "description": "实现 Jupyter kernel 协议的消息接收、分发与回复，包括 execute、complete、inspect、history、comm 等请求类型。",
        "evidence": [
          "ipykernel/kernelbase.py:Kernel",
          "ipykernel/ipkernel.py:IPythonKernel",
          "ipykernel/kernelapp.py:IPKernelApp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "代码执行与 IPython 集成",
        "description": "委托 IPython 的 InteractiveShell 执行用户代码，管理 user_ns、magics、completer，并捕获 stdout/stderr。",
        "evidence": [
          "ipykernel/ipkernel.py:IPythonKernel",
          "ipykernel/zmqshell.py:ZMQInteractiveShell"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "ZeroMQ 网络通信",
        "description": "通过 ROUTER/DEALER/XPUB/PULL/PUSH/PAIR 等 ZeroMQ 套接字构建 shell、control、iopub、stdin、heartbeat、debugpy 通道。",
        "evidence": [
          "ipykernel/kernelapp.py:init_sockets",
          "ipykernel/iostream.py:IOPubThread",
          "ipykernel/heartbeat.py:Heartbeat"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "输出流转发",
        "description": "在后台线程中把 sys.stdout/stderr 重定向并封装为 stream 消息，经 IOPub 发送给前端。",
        "evidence": [
          "ipykernel/iostream.py:OutStream",
          "ipykernel/iostream.py:IOPubThread"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "调试器支持",
        "description": "通过 debugpy 实现 Jupyter 调试器协议（DAP）适配，支持断点、单步、变量查看等。",
        "evidence": [
          "ipykernel/debugger.py:Debugger"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "GUI 事件循环集成",
        "description": "可选地让 kernel 与 Qt、wxWidgets、Tk、GTK、macOS Cocoa 等 GUI 事件循环协同工作，使交互式绘图/界面代码可在内核中运行。",
        "evidence": [
          "ipykernel/eventloops.py",
          "ipykernel/gui/gtkembed.py",
          "ipykernel/gui/gtk3embed.py",
          "ipykernel/_eventloop_macos.py"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Kernelspec 与安装",
        "description": "生成并安装 Jupyter kernelspec，使 Jupyter 客户端可以发现并启动该内核。",
        "evidence": [
          "ipykernel/kernelspec.py",
          "ipykernel_launcher.py"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "interactive computing / Jupyter kernel",
    "target_users": "Jupyter 前端开发者、需要嵌入交互式 Python 执行引擎的科学计算/数据科学工具开发者"
  },
